            owl:unionOf ( <https://openminds.om-i.org/types/Book> <https://openminds.om-i.org/types/Chapter> <https://openminds.om-i.org/types/LearningResource> <https://openminds.om-i.org/types/ScholarlyArticle> ) ] ;
